    "detailed_description": "A casual puzzle game.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Placing users in the urinal to achieve their goals</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Avoiding the gaze of others</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Using props to change the user's personality</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Using props to change relationships between users</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Using props to block line of sight</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make everyone happy</li></ul><br>The gaze behind one's body, the malicious gaze, and the hat that greatly changes one's temperament are full of doubts and confusion. &quot;Did you pee today?&quot; seemed like a greeting, but secretly revealed an unknown secret<br><br>TOiLET! Exploring the hidden rules of using the restroom in the midst of joyful hustle and bustle, strategizing, meticulous, and meticulous, is the key to truly experiencing the exhilaration.<br><br>Break one's own shackles, get to know each other, enhance friendship, see the boundaries between people, and not become the hell of others.<br><br>Let's go to the toilet and go make fun of it!",
